Date: 2026-10-26
Recorder: Codex, Prime
State: seed notes for 05.01.md; not newly enacted law.

N01. Director asks whether a Builder can begin and whether work can move into the
work book. Prime assessment: yes for bounded, released work and explicit manual
handoffs. Autonomous Clerk routing is a later finish line. Source: current exchange.

N02. Existing packs/returns must survive. A clean local workflow should add one
canonical location per new batch/return instead of migrating everything or keeping
two edited copies. Proposed landing: 01.md, 05.01 #03, README pointers.

N03. Git byte custody: installed files were exact while initial stored blobs were
not. Pack A caught this, Pack B added tracked attributes and stage/commit checks.
Source: Pack A and B returns and Prime reviews. Preserve failed evidence and the
fact the original archived helper predates the stored-blob fix.

N04. 00.live now reflects records reproducibly, but its parser does not validate
cross-references. Current valid record is usable. Future executable context must
reject missing books/jobs and undeclared space. Source: Prime B report PR-B01.

N05. Role language must preserve intelligence: routine implementation choices
inside delegated scope belong to Prime/Builder; consequential scope or contract
changes escalate. Expected negative-test refusals are not operational failures.
Source: PR-B02. Record as proposed role clarification, not silently seated law.

N06. B-F1 same 0300 in another book is not itself a collision. B-F2 versioned work
furniture and B-F3 provisional sentinel do not justify another broad cleanup pass.
Source: PR-B03. Record genuine definition conflicts separately if found.

N07. Loader adaptation requires explicitly authorized body edits and new candidate
versions where behavior changes. Preserve source and derived identity. The old lint
false-pass remains open. Source: PR-B04, 0611.findings F01/F04/F05.

N08. Finished repo pieces must preserve reproducible instructions, prerequisites,
pitfalls and why. 05.NN holds development; final05 consolidates only after useful
execution and review. Original meaningful Director replies must survive cleanup.
Source: notes/understanding-and-reuse-2026-10-26.md and current Director history.

N09. Workshop research paper explains intended expert-team operation and assumptions.
It is not evidence that runtime, routing, Observer or multi-desk autonomy is built.
Source: D:\Research\Librarian\Librarian-as-a-Workshop-Expert-Directed-Workflow-2026-10-26.md.

