R07. The paper, section 9, says Pack B had no verified return at that snapshot.
Prime later accepted Pack B at `befac9f`. The paper's sentence is history.
Section 8's multi-desk workshop, section 7's Clerk-brought repo piece, and the
Observer are not current implementation. Section 9 also separates Pack A's
19 passes plus one skipped symlink test from the handoff lab's 20 acceptance
