R08. `write_contents.py` writes `0011.contents/01.001.md` only. The work sentinel
`00.md` names that file. Neither was edited.
R09. This shell has no `python` on `PATH`. The interpreter used is recorded in
the return. That is an environment fact, not a product failure.
R10. A second checkout, `C:\Users\misg\.grok\worktrees\git-lib-build\lib-build`,
